<elemnt-runbook data-runbook="rotate-api-key"><ol class="elemnt-runbook"><li class="elemnt-runbook-step" data-gate="none"><p class="elemnt-runbook-title">Create the new key</p><pre><code class="language-sh">acme keys create --name prod-2026
</code></pre></li><li class="elemnt-runbook-step" data-gate="approve"><p class="elemnt-runbook-title">Revoke the old key<span class="elemnt-runbook-gate">Approval required</span></p><pre><code class="language-sh">acme keys revoke prod-2025
</code></pre><p class="elemnt-runbook-expect">Expected output matches <code>revoked prod-2025</code></p></li></ol></elemnt-runbook>
<hr>
